 "stem": "When the polynomial $A$ is divided by $x+{=p}$, the quotient is $x+{=q}$ and the remainder is ${=r}$. Find $A$ in expanded form.",
 "solution": [
  "Use $A = B \\times Q + R$ with $B = x+{=p}$, $Q = x+{=q}$ and $R = {=r}$.",
  "$A = (x+{=p})(x+{=q}) + {=r}$.",
  "Multiply: $(x+{=p})(x+{=q}) = x^2 + {=q}x + {=p}x + {=m} = x^2 + {=s}x + {=m}$.",
  "Add the remainder: $x^2 + {=s}x + {=m} + {=r} = x^2 + {=s}x + {=c}$.",
  "So $A = x^2 + {=s}x + {=c}$."
 ],
